{"title":"Career roadmap · AR/VR Developer","role":"AR/VR Developer","summary":"An AR/VR Developer builds interactive 3D applications and immersive experiences for devices such as VR headsets, AR-enabled mobile devices, spatial-computing platforms and mixed-reality systems.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An AR/VR Developer builds interactive 3D applications and immersive experiences for devices such as VR headsets, AR-enabled mobile devices, spatial-computing platforms and mixed-reality systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"3D mathematics"},{"text":"Game engines"},{"text":"Computer graphics"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"AR/VR interaction"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Mobile/device development"},{"text":"AI and computer vision"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","C#/C++","Unity/Unreal","3D Mathematics","3D Development","XR SDKs","Computer Graphics","Portfolio","Internship"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The field is broader than gaming. AR/VR skills can lead into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Training simulations"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Defence simulation"},{"text":"Industrial digital twins"},{"text":"Virtual production"},{"text":"Spatial computing"}]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Programming + mathematics + graphics basics"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"Unity/Unreal + 3D development"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"AR/VR + XR interaction + optimisation"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Production project + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"t