:"Create a simplified 3D representation of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Factory"},{"text":"Machine"},{"text":"Warehouse"},{"text":"Production line"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensor data"},{"text":"Real-time status"},{"text":"Interactive inspection"},{"text":"Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This opens a pathway beyond gaming into enterprise XR."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year capstone"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Powered Mixed Reality Training Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","AR/VR Headset","XR Application"]},{"type":"p","text":"├── 3D Environment"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Interaction System"},{"type":"p","text":"├── AI Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Voice Interface"},{"type":"flow","items":["└── Analytics","Backend API","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"The system could provide:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interactive training"},{"text":"AI guidance"},{"text":"Performance scoring"},{"text":"Progress tracking"},{"text":"Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is stronger than a simple VR game because it demonstrates XR + AI + backend + analytics."}]},{"heading":"Performance optimisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is essential."},{"type":"p","text":"AR/VR applications are sensitive to latency and frame rate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Draw calls"},{"text":"Polygon count"},{"text":"Texture optimisation"},{"text":"Batching"},{"text":"Level of detail"},{"text":"Occlusion culling"},{"text":"Object pooling"},{"text":"Memory management"},{"text":"CPU/GPU profiling"},{"text":"Asset compression"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important principle"},{"type":"p","text":"A visually impressive XR application that runs poorly is not a successful XR application."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to profile before guessing about performance problems."}]},{"heading":"Mobile and device development","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For AR:"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Android"},{"text":"iOS"},{"text":"Device sensors"},{"text":"Camera"},{"text":"GPS"},{"text":"Accelerometer"},{"text":"Gyroscope"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For VR/MR:"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headset hardware"},{"text":"Controllers"},{"text":"Tracking systems"},{"text":"Display resolution"},{"text":"Refresh rate"},{"text":"Battery/performance constraints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual supported devices and SDKs change rapidly, so verify the current engine and platform documentation when starting a production project."}]},{"heading":"Backend development","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern XR applications often require backend services."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Cloud storage"},{"text":"User accounts"},{"text":"Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python/FastAPI or Node.js"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"Firebase/Supabase"},{"text":"Cloud services"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You don't need to become a full-stack specialist, but you should be able to connect your XR application to a backend."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AR/VR Intern"},{"text":"XR Developer Intern"},{"text":"Unity Developer Intern"},{"text":"Game Developer Intern"},{"text":"3D Developer Intern"},{"text":"Immersive Technology Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Computing Intern"},{"text":"Simulation Developer Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industries"},{"type":"p","text":"Look beyond gaming:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gaming studios"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Healthcare technology"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Defence simulation"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Media/entertainment"}]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For XR careers, a playable/demo portfolio is extremely important."},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short description"},{"text":"Problem statement"},{"text":"Technology stack"},{"text":"Screenshots"},{"text":"Video demonstration"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Performance considerations"},{"text":"GitHub where appropriate"},{"text":"Download/demo instructions where appropriate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"4 strong projects > 20 basic Unity tutorials"}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are less important than a working portfolio."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"C#"},{"text":"C++"},{"text":"OpenXR"},{"text":"ARCore/ARKit"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"3D mathematics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A platform-specific certification can be useful if it is recognised by employers, but don't substitute it for demonstrable development ability."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior AR/VR Developer"},{"text":"XR Developer"},{"text":"Unity Developer"},{"text":"Junior Game Developer"},{"text":"AR Developer"},{"text":"VR Developer"},{"text":"3D Application Developer"},{"text":"Immersive Technology Developer"},{"text":"Simulation Developer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AR/VR Engineer"},{"text":"XR Engineer"},{"text":"Senior Unity Developer"},{"text":"Unreal Developer"},{"text":"Spatial Computing Developer"},{"text":"Technical XR Developer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{