tion"},{"text":"Tracking stability"},{"text":"Comfort settings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 3"},{"type":"p","text":"The application works well on a development PC but performs badly on the headset."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GPU load"},{"text":"Draw calls"},{"text":"Texture size"},{"text":"Polygon count"},{"text":"Shader complexity"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"CPU workload"},{"text":"Device-specific constraints"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's is not mandatory for an AR/VR developer."},{"type":"p","text":"Portfolio and practical skills are extremely important."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"h","text":"MCA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for deeper software engineering."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Computer Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for graphics/software fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Game Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for game/XR development."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Tech Computer Graphics / Visual Computing"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for advanced graphics."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Tech AI/ML"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for AI + XR."},{"type":"h","text":"M.Des / Interaction Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for spatial UX and interaction design, depending on career direction."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer Graphics"},{"text":"Game Development"},{"text":"XR/Extended Reality"},{"text":"Virtual Reality"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Interactive Media"},{"text":"Visual Computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technical XR career, programmes combining computer graphics + HCI + real-time systems + XR can be particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Choose a specialisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After 2–4 years, choose one direction."},{"type":"h","text":"Game development"},{"type":"flow","items":["Unity/Unreal","gameplay","graphics","networking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AR development"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer vision","mobile","spatial tracking"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"VR/MR"},{"type":"flow","items":["XR interaction","spatial computing","simulation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"XR + AI"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer vision","LLMs","multimodal AI","agents"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Graphics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Rendering","shaders","GPU programming","mathematics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial XR"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital twins","IoT","simulation","enterprise systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"XR UX"},{"type":"flow","items":["HCI","3D interaction","spatial interfaces"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"AI + XR future","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the strongest emerging combinations is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI","XR","Spatial Computing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Future applications can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI virtual instructors"},{"text":"Intelligent avatars"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"},{"text":"Natural-language 3D creation"},{"text":"Gesture-controlled interfaces"},{"text":"Computer-vision-based environments"},{"text":"AI-powered simulations"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Spatial AI assistants"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The developer increasingly becomes responsible for building the entire interactive AI/XR system, not just the 3D environment."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 career evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Developer"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern:"},{"typ